295
00:33:22,299 --> 00:33:23,680
İşte sonradan kontrgerilla,

296
00:33:23,879 --> 00:33:25,720
ta 71 darbesinde,

297
00:33:27,159 --> 00:33:29,720
ünlü Ziverbey Köşkü ile ilk defa adı,

298
00:33:30,420 --> 00:33:32,220
toplumun gündemine gelen,

299
00:33:32,559 --> 00:33:35,059
